# Lilypad Village ("Activate only if a Bird, Frog, Otter, or Rat entered the battlefield under your control this turn", CR 602.5b):
# the ruling says it doesn't matter what happens to that creature after it enters. Burrog Banemaker (a Frog) enters and is killed
# by Lightning Bolt before the village is activated: the surveil is still allowed, read from the Frog as it entered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lilypad Village
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Burrog Banemaker
Lightning Bolt
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Lilypad Village.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Burrog Banemaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Burrog Banemaker)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Burrog Banemaker; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Lilypad Village.Activate(Ability: Surveil 2)
Bot1.Arrange( | Plains; Plains)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Lilypad Village.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
